WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.564 --> 00:00:21.065
swung the stick at Gildong.

2
00:00:22.505 --> 00:00:25.307
In a flash Gildong grabbed Inhyun's arm.

3
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:28.308
He flipped Inhyun onto the ground.

4
00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:32.685
"Ahh!" Inhyun cried.

5
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:37.048
Inhyun's mother, Lady Yoo, rushed out.

6
00:00:37.068 --> 00:00:41.171
"He beat me with a stick!

7
00:00:42.332 --> 00:00:44.113
And he threw me across the yard!"

8
00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:46.215
Inhyun said between sobs.

9
00:00:46.235 --> 00:00:49.717
"He's lying," Gildong said.

10
00:00:49.737 --> 00:00:52.559
"He tried to beat me with a stick."

11
00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.601
Lady Yoo narrowed her eyes.

12
00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.924
"How dare you hurt my son!

13
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.301
I'll tell my husband about this.

14
00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:05.223
He'll make you pay for it."

15
00:01:09.366 --> 00:01:12.328
She grabbed Inhyun's hand and they walked away.

16
00:01:18.552 --> 00:01:19.673
Gildong sighed.

17
00:01:19.693 --> 00:01:23.255
"These two will get me in more trouble with Lord Hong!"

18
00:01:26.557 --> 00:01:30.220
For three days and nights, Gildong had to stay in his room.

19
00:01:34.289 --> 00:01:37.411
By the third day of his punishment, he was bored.

20
00:01:41.592 --> 00:01:43.873
Late that night he sneaked outside.

21
00:01:46.634 --> 00:01:49.295
He climbed a tree and looked up at the moon.

22
00:01:55.138 --> 00:01:56.858
things be better if Mother was alive?"

23
00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:57.839
he thought.

24
00:01:57.859 --> 00:02:00.460
"I feel so alone in this house."

25
00:02:02.216 --> 00:02:05.678
In the moonlight Gildong saw something moving below.

26
00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.100
It was Lord Hong.

27
00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:13.603
"Why are you out here, Gildong?"

28
00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:14.523
he asked.

29
00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:17.005
Gildong said nothing.

30
00:02:19.927 --> 00:02:21.648
"Speak," Lord Hong said.

31
00:02:21.668 --> 00:02:24.529
"Why can't I call you Father?"

32
00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.070
Gildong blurted out.

33
00:02:26.971 --> 00:02:28.592
Tears ran down his cheeks.

34
00:02:32.176 --> 00:02:33.377
Lord Hong sighed.

35
00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:36.539
"It is the law of the land.

36
00:02:37.219 --> 00:02:37.879
You know that."

37
00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:41.121
"Why is it the law of the land?

38
00:02:41.781 --> 00:02:43.722
It's cruel," Gildong said.

39
00:02:43.742 --> 00:02:47.364
"The law makes me an outcast in this house."

40
00:02:48.885 --> 00:02:51.667
"Stop speaking nonsense," Lord Hong said.

41
00:02:51.687 --> 00:02:54.989
"You're not the only lowborn child of a noble.

42
00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.770
You must accept your position."

43
00:02:59.191 --> 00:03:01.012
Gildong knew he shouldn't say more.

44
00:03:01.996 --> 00:03:03.477
But he couldn't stop himself.

45
00:03:03.497 --> 00:03:06.120
"What if I can't accept it?"

46
00:03:10.063 --> 00:03:12.905
"Enough. Your punishment isn't over.

47
00:03:14.006 --> 00:03:16.428
Get back to your room," Lord Hong said.

48
00:03:20.591 --> 00:03:22.713
Gildong jumped down and obeyed.

49
00:03:26.857 --> 00:03:30.580
One day Gildong met a new servant named Mongdol.

50
00:03:31.804 --> 00:03:34.466
Mongdol looked closely at Gildong's face.

51
00:03:34.486 --> 00:03:39.888
"Tee-hee-hee. You're Gildong, the servant's son!"

52
00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:45.551
not a servant.

53
00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.073
My mother was," Gildong said.

54
00:03:49.334 --> 00:03:50.474
Mongdol grinned.

55
00:03:50.494 --> 00:03:53.296
"There's nothing wrong with being a servant."

56
00:03:54.656 --> 00:03:56.117
Gildong was surprised.

57
00:03:57.038 --> 00:04:00.359
Most of the servants ignored him or talked behind his back.

58
00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:03.933
This one seemed friendly and curious.

59
00:04:03.953 --> 00:04:08.595
"I'm all alone in this house because of my birth," Gildong said.

60
00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:13.257
"Tee-hee-hee. I'll be your friend," Mongdol said.

61
00:04:13.277 --> 00:04:15.038
"My friend?"

62
00:04:15.878 --> 00:04:18.199
Gildong had never had a friend before.

63
00:04:18.219 --> 00:04:23.101
"Everyone says you're very strong.

64
00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:24.962
Want to arm-wrestle?"

65
00:04:25.282 --> 00:04:26.222
Mongdol asked.

66
00:04:28.203 --> 00:04:29.804
"Sure," Gildong said.

67
00:04:32.008 --> 00:04:38.751
The two arm-wrestled, but neither
